          {
            "text": "Current medication per EMR, reconciled today; started approximately “18/12 ago” per EMR. Patient reports mostly adherent, sometimes missing one dose if she forgets. Reports no significant side effects. Plan is to continue sertraline 50 mg at night."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
